n><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>1. 与相关领域专家、导师直接合作，共享清华大学及合作伙伴的优质科研资源；</span></span></section><section><span><span>2. 获得科研成果落地转化指导、发表顶级学术期刊/会议论文（作者顺序按照贡献排序)；</span></span></section><section><span><span>3. 根据实际表现收获相关导师推荐（包括但不限于推荐信）；</span></span></section><section><span><span>4. 参与国内外知名院校导师主办的讲座、论坛、竞赛活动；</span></span></section><section><span><span>5. 与一群和你同样优秀的小伙伴同向同行，共同进步。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>我们希望你</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>1. 研究生/本科高年级海内外知名院校在校生；</span></span></section><section><span><span>2. 热爱科研，基础素质优异，创新与实践能力突出；</span></span></section><section><span><span>3. 夏令营期间至少保证有1-2个月的线下工作时间；</span></span></section><section><span><span>4. 有机器人、计算机视觉、机器学习、操作系统、电子工程、自动化、计算机、机械、应用数学等方向研究经验的申请者优先考虑。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业要求</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>电子工程、自动化、计算机、人工智能等方向的相关专业。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>指导老师</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong><strong><span>兰艳艳</span></strong><span> </span></strong><span><span>AIR首席研究员/教授 前中国科学院计算技术研究所研究员</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>周谷越 </span></strong><span><span>AIR副研究员/副教授 前大疆集</span></span><span><span>团技术负责人/产品经理/科学家</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>詹仙园</span><span> </span><span><span><span><span>AIR副研究员/副教授 前京东科技数据科学家/资深研究员</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>马为之 </span></strong></span><span><span>AIR副研究员/副教授 清华大学计算机系水木学者</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>李元春 </span></strong><span><span>AIR助理研究员/助理教授 前微软亚洲研究院主管研究员</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>王　岩 </span></strong><span>AIR助理研究员/助理教授 前商汤科技高级研究员</span></span></p><p><span><span>赵　昊</span><span> AIR助理研究员/助理教授 前英特尔中国研究院研究员</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>李　琨 </span></strong><span>AIR助理研究员/助理教授 </span><span>长期从事高性能计算与人工智能在科学与工程领域的交叉研究</span></span></p><p><span><em><span><span>*详细师资力量简介请参考AIR官网：</span></span></em></span><span><span>https://air.tsinghua.edu.cn/airtd/gcbs.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>AIR长期招聘人工智能领域优秀科研人员</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>点这里关注我们</span></strong></span></p><section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>关于AIR</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>清华大学智能产业研究院（Institute for AI Industry Research, Tsinghua University，英文简称AIR，THU）是面向第四次工业革命的国际化、智能化、产业化的校级研究机构。AIR的使命是利用人工智能技术赋能产业升级、推动社会进步。通过大学与企业创新双引擎，突破人工智能核心技术，培养智能产业领军人才，推动智能产业跨越式发展。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>AIR于2020年由多媒体及人工智能领域的世界级科学家、企业家张亚勤院士创建。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>智慧交通（AI＋Transportation）、智慧物联（AI＋IoT）、智慧医疗（AI＋Life Science）是清华大学智能产业研究院的三个重点研发方向。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>往期精彩：</span></span></section><section><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NDg0OTI1MQ==&amp;mid=2247501426&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8470bf3f36bb6107589d3049338250c0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【立即预约】2026“太湖对话：The New Era of Agentic AI”活动</a></span></span></section><section><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NDg0OTI1MQ==&amp;mid=2247501424&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ef1d1e34b3e5f448d084c2d896ba59f2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">祝贺！AIR兰艳艳团队DrugCLIP再创佳绩：在国际药物发现赛事CACHE Challenge #6中获得唯一高置信度命中</a></span></span></section><section><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NDg0OTI1MQ==&amp;mid=2247501413&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0e8e096c673f3c188f7b88bc6e6475cf&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AIR科研 | 新范式搭建视觉感知的“快速路”：让视觉模型实时理解直播视频流</a></span></span></section><section><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NDg0OTI1MQ==&amp;mid=2247501378&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b15b2dbab922c2d8ecde54b119b8eb2e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AIR孵化｜紫荆智康发布“紫荆AI医院”线上虚拟诊室</a></span></span></section><section><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NDg0OTI1MQ==&amp;mid=2247501373&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0eeb8d5e8b164d3dff83d85be6afcb66&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">张亚勤院士出席博鳌亚洲论坛2026年会</a></span></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cace6029ef4e6a149a24d018b25110e3964c2a3657f153cd2bfe10c0fa61959c","textLength":1412,"sourceSha256":"9ee22613a01b79ca1cbc5438f47b65cf9bf8b5ebc2c46400706b3125c737488f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-54a0842fc625df45dbd6","title":"2026年清华大学智能产业研究院2026夏令营开始报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.840699+00:00"}
